          "output": "Seq Scan on line_items  (cost=0.00..48211.00 rows=14 width=96) (actual time=0.031..212.447 rows=14 loops=1)\n  Filter: (invoice_id = 1)\n  Rows Removed by Filter: 2399986\nExecution Time: 212.492 ms",
          "diff": null
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "itemId": "a1",
          "text": "Each invoice reads **all** of `line_items`: there's no index on `invoice_id`, so the job does one full scan per invoice.\n\n| Step | Time per invoice |\n|---|---|\n| Load line items | 212 ms |\n| Render PDF | 18 ms |\n| Send email | 9 ms |\n\nAn index removes almost all of it:\n\n```sql\nCREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY line_items_invoice_id ON line_items (invoice_id);\n```\n\nWith about 9,000 invoices a night, that's roughly half an hour saved."
        },
